(7640202, 1240613, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely image but it sits just a little too low contrast or "random film filter applied" for me. 7 as is but would likely have been top 3 otherwise.</td>', 'Lovely image but it sits just a little too low contrast or "random film filter applied" for me. 7 as is but would likely have been top 3 otherwise.', '2019-09-02 14:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640248, 1240294, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinary, Im thinking obviously its Ammie. There is always a golden glow in every one of your pictures. Obviously you are shooting in the golden hour... this one is pure magical. Ive seen scenes  like this in movies, where the cattle are moving along and lifting up the dust from the ground and often thought I would love to be there one day witnessing and photographing this special event.  This is probably one of your best landscapes ever. <br/> <br/> My top pick for sure, pretty sure its the blue. All the best!</td>', 'This is extraordinary, Im thinking obviously its Ammie. There is always a golden glow in every one of your pictures. Obviously you are shooting in the golden hour... this one is pure magical. Ive seen scenes  like this in movies, where the cattle are moving along and lifting up the dust from the ground and often thought I would love to be there one day witnessing and photographing this special event.  This is probably one of your best landscapes ever.   My top pick for sure, pretty sure its the blue. All the best!', '2019-09-03 00:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7640284, 1240437, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really like this, and am scoring 8.  If there was a little more contrast and a little less HDR feel to the foreground, it would have been a 9 or 10.</td>', 'I really like this, and am scoring 8.  If there was a little more contrast and a little less HDR feel to the foreground, it would have been a 9 or 10.', '2019-09-03 10:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
