(7640289, 1240613, 67258, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, but I find my eyes straining towards the light rather than being gently led there.  The dark 2/3rds of he photo lack contrast and have a faintly murky feel. Personally I feel you have gone a bit too slow on the shutter - whilst it can be good to smooth out the water a bit, here there is no sense of movement at all.</td>', 'The composition is good, but I find my eyes straining towards the light rather than being gently led there.  The dark 2/3rds of he photo lack contrast and have a faintly murky feel. Personally I feel you have gone a bit too slow on the shutter - whilst it can be good to smooth out the water a bit, here there is no sense of movement at all.', '2019-09-03 10:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
