(7641007, 1240294, 86218, '<td valign="top">Fantastiese Foto. Kry min kans en wil graag meer hier kyk en dalk probeer neem op n slag. Lyk my jy het almal uitgestof met die atmosferiese foto wat elke digter sal laat gryp na sy pen. Goed gedoen - Blou verdiend</td>', 'Fantastiese Foto. Kry min kans en wil graag meer hier kyk en dalk probeer neem op n slag. Lyk my jy het almal uitgestof met die atmosferiese foto wat elke digter sal laat gryp na sy pen. Goed gedoen - Blou verdiend', '2019-09-09 06:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641008, 1240579, 53200, '<td valign="top">Way to go Deb - TTA (top ten again!!!)</td>', 'Way to go Deb - TTA (top ten again!!!)', '2019-09-09 08:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641010, 1240579, 250302, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the beach, and was so pleased to capture this shot on Southwold Beach, UK.  I was stressing over the blustery winds that day thinking they were going to "interfere" with the shot. Then we get to the beach, and there are so many folks there enjoying their last weekend before school starts back, I just knew that shot I had envisioned in my head was not going to happen that day.  But turns out, the wind displayed itself wonderfully adding to the mood of the photo, and with a little strategic maneuvering and stooping I was able to block out most of the people/beach equipment/umbrella behind the huts.  I do love the colors of the huts, they add wonderfully to the photo!!  Thank you for your votes and comments.  Thrilled to have made it in the top 10 again!</td>', 'I LOVE the beach, and was so pleased to capture this shot on Southwold Beach, UK.  I was stressing over the blustery winds that day thinking they were going to "interfere" with the shot. Then we get to the beach, and there are so many folks there enjoying their last weekend before school starts back, I just knew that shot I had envisioned in my head was not going to happen that day.  But turns out, the wind displayed itself wonderfully adding to the mood of the photo, and with a little strategic maneuvering and stooping I was able to block out most of the people/beach equipment/umbrella behind the huts.  I do love the colors of the huts, they add wonderfully to the photo!!  Thank you for your votes and comments.  Thrilled to have made it in the top 10 again!', '2019-09-09 08:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641015, 1240270, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how the post lines up with the horizon and divides the photo. An interesting and energetic composition so often missing from landscapes.</td>', 'I love how the post lines up with the horizon and divides the photo. An interesting and energetic composition so often missing from landscapes.', '2019-09-09 13:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
