(7641168, 1240231, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh how PRETTY!  I can''t tell if the sun is rising or setting, but the beauty of this moment sends serenity right thru me! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sunrise, and thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Oh how PRETTY!  I can''t tell if the sun is rising or setting, but the beauty of this moment sends serenity right thru me!   Sunrise, and thanks.', '2019-09-11 02:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641190, 1240607, 135744, '<td valign="top">Superb photograph of an amazing looking location. Congrats!<br/> <br/>BTW I am curious if you used a filter on your lens to create such a large star on the sun? It looks super but I have never managed to make one that big</td>', 'Superb photograph of an amazing looking location. Congrats! BTW I am curious if you used a filter on your lens to create such a large star on the sun? It looks super but I have never managed to make one that big', '2019-09-11 12:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641246, 1240607, 61012, '<td valign="top">P-A-U-L ask if I used a filter for the starburst. No just shot at very small aperture. I think the sun still being on the horizon helped too</td>', 'P-A-U-L ask if I used a filter for the starburst. No just shot at very small aperture. I think the sun still being on the horizon helped too', '2019-09-12 17:21:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641258, 1240294, 112739, '<td valign="top">I''m finally to a spot with good internet! At least for a night. We are still traveling through Alaska and Canada.  <br/> <br/>Ammie, this is fabulous! The atmosphere is so special. Thank you for not over processing this!</td>', 'I''m finally to a spot with good internet! At least for a night. We are still traveling through Alaska and Canada.   Ammie, this is fabulous! The atmosphere is so special. Thank you for not over processing this!', '2019-09-12 21:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7641466, 1240580, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way you shot through the rigging in the foreground. I agree that it is interesting to compare our two shots that landed right next to each other in this challenge. Yours didn''t get any strong dislike, but not any strong love either. Got a 6 from me, if you care about that.</td>', 'I like the way you shot through the rigging in the foreground. I agree that it is interesting to compare our two shots that landed right next to each other in this challenge. Yours didn''t get any strong dislike, but not any strong love either. Got a 6 from me, if you care about that.', '2019-09-15 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 0);
